  "wanting to drive out",
  "that nuisance, Karaba,",
  "was, for a politician,",
  "only natural.",
  "Psycho Gundam",
  "The Monster Called the Economy",
  "MRX-009、",
  "The so-called Psycho Gundam",
  "was, of all that the Federation's",
  "Gundam fantasy brought forth,",
  "a weapon that may fairly be called",
