  "dragged the Psycho Gundam--",
  "a machine meant to end its days",
  "in the laboratory--",
  "out onto the battlefield.",
  "Ever since humanity",
  "first came by money,",
  "people's lives",
  "have been ruled by it.",
  "State systems, ethnicities,",
  "even whether one is on Earth--",
  "none of it matters;",
