  "So long as people live",
  "as part of a society,",
  "money means survival.",
  "In space, this was",
  "especially pronounced.",
  "On Earth,",
  "however little money one had,",
  "the land and even the air",
  "would never disappear.",
  "Earth's environment",
  "existed before money was ever",
