  "it allows human beings",
  "to live within it.",
  "Not so the people of space.",
  "On the Moon or in a colony,",
  "the air and the water--",
  "all of it was made by somebody.",
  "And so,",
  "it must be paid for.",
  "It is nothing like tax evasion",
