  "the General Staff's actions",
  "were as good as a death sentence.",
  "The AEUG set its sights on that.",
  "With Anaheim's resources,",
  "in the form of covering late wages,",
  "it built a system that paid",
  "soldiers a reward",
  "for joining the AEUG.",
  "On paper, part of the regulars;",
  "in reality, by becoming",
  "a cell of the AEUG,",
  "one got paid.",
  "This system",
  "won explosive support,",
  "and it was also why the AEUG,",
